#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:153
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"function! s:on_lsp_buffer_enabled() abort\n"
"    setlocal omnifunc=lsp#complete\n"
"    setlocal completeopt-=preview\n"
"    setlocal keywordprg=:LspHover\n"
msgstr "function! s:on_lsp_buffer_enabled() abort\n    setlocal omnifunc=lsp#complete\n    setlocal completeopt-=preview\n    setlocal keywordprg=:LspHover\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:167
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"    nmap <buffer> <C-]> <plug>(lsp-definition)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> <C-W>] <plug>(lsp-peek-definition)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> <C-W><C-]> <plug>(lsp-peek-definition)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> gr <plug>(lsp-references)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> <C-n> <plug>(lsp-next-reference)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> <C-p> <plug>(lsp-previous-reference)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> gI <plug>(lsp-implementation)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> go <plug>(lsp-document-symbol)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> gS <plug>(lsp-workspace-symbol)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> ga <plug>(lsp-code-action)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> gR <plug>(lsp-rename)\n"
"    nmap <buffer> gm <plug>(lsp-signature-help)\n"
"endfunction\n"
msgstr "    nmap <buffer> <C-]> <plug>(lsp-definition)\n    nmap <buffer> <C-W>] <plug>(lsp-peek-definition)\n    nmap <buffer> <C-W><C-]> <plug>(lsp-peek-definition)\n    nmap <buffer> gr <plug>(lsp-references)\n    nmap <buffer> <C-n> <plug>(lsp-next-reference)\n    nmap <buffer> <C-p> <plug>(lsp-previous-reference)\n    nmap <buffer> gI <plug>(lsp-implementation)\n    nmap <buffer> go <plug>(lsp-document-symbol)\n    nmap <buffer> gS <plug>(lsp-workspace-symbol)\n    nmap <buffer> ga <plug>(lsp-code-action)\n    nmap <buffer> gR <plug>(lsp-rename)\n    nmap <buffer> gm <plug>(lsp-signature-help)\nendfunction\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:172
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"augroup lsp_install\n"
"    au!\n"
"    autocmd User lsp_buffer_enabled call s:on_lsp_buffer_enabled()\n"
"augroup END\n"
msgstr "augroup lsp_install\n    au!\n    autocmd User lsp_buffer_enabled call s:on_lsp_buffer_enabled()\naugroup END\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:175
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "VSCode"
msgstr "VSCode"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:182
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"LSP client plugins are required to launch the language server daemon.  Press "
"`Ctrl+Shift+X` to show the extension online search panel.  Enter `llvm-vs-"
"code-extensions.vscode-clangd` when running clangd, or `ccls-project.ccls` "
"when running ccls."
msgstr "需要安装 LSP 客户端插件才能启动语言服务器守护进程。按 `Ctrl+Shift+X` 打开扩展在线搜索面板。使用 clangd 时输入 `llvm-vs-code-extensions.vscode-clangd`，使用 ccls 时输入 `ccls-project.ccls`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:186
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then, press `Ctrl+Shift+P` to show the editor commands palette.  Enter "
"`Preferences: Open Settings (JSON)` into the palette and hit `Enter` to open "
"[.filepath]#settings.json#.  Depending on the language server "
"implementations, put one of the following JSON key/value pairs in [."
"filepath]#settings.json#:"
msgstr "然后，按 `Ctrl+Shift+P` 打开编辑器命令面板。在面板中输入 `Preferences: Open Settings (JSON)`，再按 `Enter` 打开 [.filepath]#settings.json#。根据语言服务器实现，在 [.filepath]#settings.json# 中加入以下 JSON 键值对之一："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:200
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[\n"
"    /* Begin of your existing configurations */\n"
"    ...\n"
"    /* End of your existing configurations */\n"
"    \"clangd.arguments\": [\n"
"        \"--background-index\",\n"
"        \"--header-insertion=never\"\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"clangd.path\": \"clangd12\"\n"
"]\n"
msgstr "[\n    /* Begin of your existing configurations */\n    ...\n    /* End of your existing configurations */\n    \"clangd.arguments\": [\n        \"--background-index\",\n        \"--header-insertion=never\"\n    ],\n    \"clangd.path\": \"clangd12\"\n]\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:211
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[\n"
"    /* Begin of your existing configurations */\n"
"    ...\n"
"    /* End of your existing configurations */\n"
"    \"ccls.cache.hierarchicalPath\": true\n"
"]\n"
msgstr "[\n    /* Begin of your existing configurations */\n    ...\n    /* End of your existing configurations */\n    \"ccls.cache.hierarchicalPath\": true\n]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:214
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Compilation database"
msgstr "编译数据库"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:220
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A Compilation database contains an array of compile command objects.  Each "
"object specifies a way of compiling a source file.  The compilation database "
"file is usually [.filename]#compile_commands.json#.  The database is used by "
"language server implementations for indexing purpose."
msgstr "编译数据库包含一个编译命令对象数组。每个对象都指定了一种编译源文件的方式。编译数据库文件通常名为 [.filename]#compile_commands.json#。语言服务器实现会使用该数据库为源代码建立索引。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please refer to link:https://clang.llvm.org/docs/JSONCompilationDatabase."
"html#format[] for details on the format of the compilation database file."
msgstr "有关编译数据库文件格式的详情，请参阅 link:https://clang.llvm.org/docs/JSONCompilationDatabase.html#format[]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:224
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Generators"
msgstr "生成器"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:227
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using scan-build-py"
msgstr "使用 scan-build-py"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:229
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:233
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`intercept-build` tool from scan-build-py is used to generate compilation "
"database."
msgstr "scan-build-py 中的 `intercept-build` 工具用于生成编译数据库。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:236
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install package:devel/python[] to get python interpreter first. To get "
"`intercept-build` from LLVM:"
msgstr "首先安装 package:devel/python[]，以获取 Python 解释器。要从 LLVM 获取 `intercept-build`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:240
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# git clone https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project /path/to/llvm-project\n"
msgstr "# git clone https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project /path/to/llvm-project\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:243
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"where [.filename]#/path/to/llvm-project/# is your desired path for the "
"repository. Make an alias in the shell configuration file for convenience:"
msgstr "其中 [.filename]#/path/to/llvm-project/# 是您希望存放该代码仓库的路径。为方便使用，请在 shell 配置文件中创建别名："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:247
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "alias intercept-build='/path/to/llvm-project/clang/tools/scan-build-py/bin/intercept-build'\n"
msgstr "alias intercept-build='/path/to/llvm-project/clang/tools/scan-build-py/bin/intercept-build'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:253
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"link:https://github.com/rizsotto/scan-build[rizsotto/scan-build] can be used "
"instead of LLVM's scan-build-py.  The LLVM's scan-build-py was rizsotto/scan-"
"build merged into the LLVM tree.  This implementation can be installed by "
"`pip install --user scan-build`.  The `intercept-build` script is in [."
"filename]#~/.local/bin# by default."
msgstr "可以使用 link:https://github.com/rizsotto/scan-build[rizsotto/scan-build] 代替 LLVM 的 scan-build-py。LLVM 的 scan-build-py 是将 rizsotto/scan-build 合并到 LLVM 源码树后的版本。此实现可以通过 `pip install --user scan-build` 安装。默认情况下，`intercept-build` 脚本位于 [.filename]#~/.local/bin#。"

#. type: Title =====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:254
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:270
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:257
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the top-level directory of the FreeBSD src tree, generate the compilation "
"database with `intercept-build`:"
msgstr "在 FreeBSD src 树的顶层目录中，使用 `intercept-build` 生成编译数据库："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:261
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# intercept-build --append make buildworld buildkernel -j`sysctl -n hw.ncpu`\n"
msgstr "# intercept-build --append make buildworld buildkernel -j`sysctl -n hw.ncpu`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:266
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `--append` flag tells the `intercept-build` to read an existing "
"compilation database (if a compilation database exists) and append the "
"results to the database.  Entries with duplicated command keys are merged.  "
"The generated compilation database by default is saved in the current "
"working directory as [.filename]#compile_commands.json#."
msgstr "`--append` 标志会让 `intercept-build` 读取现有编译数据库（如果存在），并将结果追加到数据库中。命令键重复的条目会被合并。默认情况下，生成的编译数据库会保存在当前工作目录下，文件名为 [.filename]#compile_commands.json#。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:268
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using devel/bear"
msgstr "使用 devel/bear"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:273
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the top-level directory of the FreeBSD src tree, to generate compilation "
"database with `bear`:"
msgstr "在 FreeBSD src 树的顶层目录中，使用 `bear` 生成编译数据库："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:277
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bear --append -- make buildworld buildkernel -j`sysctl -n hw.ncpu`\n"
msgstr "# bear --append -- make buildworld buildkernel -j`sysctl -n hw.ncpu`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:282
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `--append` flag tells `bear` to read an existing compilation database if "
"it is present, and append the results to the database.  Entries with "
"duplicated command keys are merged.  The generated compilation database by "
"default is saved in the current working directory as [."
"filename]#compile_commands.json#."
msgstr "如果存在现有编译数据库，`--append` 标志会让 `bear` 读取该数据库，并将结果追加其中。命令键重复的条目会被合并。默认情况下，生成的编译数据库会保存在当前工作目录下，文件名为 [.filename]#compile_commands.json#。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:284
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Final"
msgstr "结语"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-src-lsp/_index.adoc:288
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the compilation database is generated, open any source files in the "
"FreeBSD src tree and LSP server daemon will be launched as well in "
"background.  Opening source files in the src tree for the first time takes "
"significantly longer time before the LSP server is able to give a complete "
"result, due to initial background indexing by the LSP server compiling all "
"the listed entries in the compilation database.  The language server daemon "
"however does not index the source files not appearing in the compilation "
"database, thus no complete results are shown on source files not being "
"compiled during the `make`."
msgstr "生成编译数据库后，打开 FreeBSD src 树中的任意源文件，LSP 服务器守护进程也会在后台启动。首次打开 src 树中的源文件时，等待 LSP 服务器提供完整结果的时间会明显更长，因为 LSP 服务器会在后台进行初始索引，并编译编译数据库中列出的所有条目。不过，语言服务器守护进程不会为编译数据库中未列出的源文件建立索引，因此，对于 `make` 期间未编译的源文件，不会显示完整结果。"
